SUMMARY:Bus Simulator 27 | Ep. 1 - Death, War, Famine, Pestilence... and
 the Number 27 Bus
DESCRIPTION:A brand-new series begins! We're climbing behind the wheel in
 Bus Simulator 27 and attempting to provide a reliable public transport
 service. Death, War, Famine, and Pestilence were bad enough, but none of
 them had to explain why the 27 is twelve minutes late. Take the wheel and
 help transform public transport across the sunny region of Felicia Bay!
 We'll drive a huge selection of officially licensed buses, create and
 operate routes, manage timetables and grow our own bus company across two
 bustling cities and the surrounding countryside. With city buses,
 double-deckers, electric buses and, for the first time in the series,
 long-distance coaches, there's plenty of driving ahead. Expect busy
 traffic, unpredictable passengers, changing weather and hopefully a
 reasonably professional bus service as we explore everything Felicia Bay
 has to offer!
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mM7v5XtEMJU
CATEGORIES:Bus Simulator 27
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
