DTSTART:20260929T203000Z
DTEND:20260929T223000Z
SUMMARY:Dune: Awakening | Ep. 30 - New Dune Update, Arrakis Has Changed.
 Hubert Has Not
DESCRIPTION:We're heading back to Arrakis to check out the latest Dune:
 Awakening update and discover what's changed since our last visit. New
 adventures, new dangers, new possibilities... and Hubert, who presumably
 remains entirely unimpressed by all of it. Rise from survival to greatness
 and challenge the power of an Imperium in Dune: Awakening, a brand-new
 open world survival and crafting game. Alone or together with others, you
 must survive the sandworm, build a home, craft your ornithopter, and
 unravel the story of the missing Fremen.
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TorlcRjZCWw
CATEGORIES:Dune: Awakening
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stream-24682211@dr-ravenholm
DTSTAMP:20260909T010000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261002T005300Z
DTSTART:20260930T203000Z
DTEND:20260930T223000Z
SUMMARY:The Oregon Trail | Ep. 6 - The Harmonica Played. The Love &
 Dysentery Spread. Gary & Samwise Remain.
DESCRIPTION:Against all reasonable expectations, Gary and Samwise remain.
 The harmonica has played, the love has spread, the dysentery has spread
 considerably more efficiently, and somehow the wagon is still moving west.
 We should probably stop tempting fate. The Oregon Trail is back in a
 beautiful blend of charming pixel art characters, 3D environments, and
 cutting-edge lighting and visual effects!\n\nThe Oregon Trail by
 Gameloft-Experience The Oregon Trail like never before. A modern twist on
 the trials and tribulations of the road to Oregon, this official successor
 to the global phenomenon will immerse players in exhilarating journeys
 ranging from the historically accurate to the totally extreme. Players
 will pick their traveling party, stock the wagon with supplies, and embark
 on an adventure filled with tough choices, new dangers, and unexpected
 situations. Surviving blizzards, broken limbs, snakebites, exhaustion,
 starvation, and the dreaded dysentery is no small feat; all the while
 navigating an untamed frontier to get your party to their new life in
 Oregon before the winter. Track down a missing party in the aftermath of a
 fierce blizzard, transport volatile gunpowder through blistering desert
 heat, compete in challenging hunting mini-games, and meet a broad cast of
 historic figures. With procedurally selected random events where players'
 choices affect their party and future game events, there's always a new
 adventure on the horizon every time you play.
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=576GsgNm95c
CATEGORIES:The Oregon Trail
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
