SUMMARY:The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion Remastered | Ep. 3 - Lovely Place,
 Shame About the Gates to Hell
DESCRIPTION:Back to beautiful Cyrodiil, where the countryside is
 picturesque, the cities are historic, and enormous portals to a demonic
 dimension are doing terrible things to local property values. Time to see
 what trouble awaits beyond the next Oblivion Gate. Return to the province
 of Cyrodiil in a remastered version of the legendary open-world RPG. With
 the Emperor slain and mysterious Oblivion Gates opening across the land,
 we'll create our character, explore towns and ancient ruins, take on
 quests, join factions, delve into dangerous dungeons and battle the forces
 of Mehrunes Dagon. Whether we follow the main story or get completely
 distracted by side quests, there's a huge fantasy world waiting to be
 rediscovered.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion Remastered
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
