SUMMARY:Permafrost | Ep. 1 - Endless Winter? Right, I'll Put the Kettle On
DESCRIPTION: The world has been plunged into an endless winter, and
 surviving the cold is only the beginning. As a Rook-an engineer drawn into
 the frozen wasteland by a radio signal from a long-lost friend-we'll
 explore abandoned cities and wilderness, scavenge desperately needed
 supplies, craft equipment, repair technology and build a network of
 shelters. With brutal weather, dangerous factions and scarce resources
 standing in our way, we'll need to prepare carefully for every journey. At
 least we won't be completely alone, with a loyal dog companion helping us
 scout for danger and carry supplies as we uncover the story of this frozen
 post-apocalyptic world.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Permafrost
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
