SUMMARY:Sim City (1991) SNES | Ep. 1 - Residential, Commercial,
 Industrial... Pub?
DESCRIPTION: It's time to become mayor and build a city from the ground up
 in the classic SNES version of SimCity! We'll zone residential, commercial
 and industrial areas, build roads and essential services, manage the city
 budget and try to keep our growing population happy. From traffic problems
 and rising crime to fires and unexpected disasters, there's always
 something demanding the mayor's attention. Can we transform an empty
 landscape into a thriving metropolis, or will our questionable city
 planning send everyone looking for somewhere better to live?
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Sim City
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
